hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"818","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Har nabi ke liye apni ummat ke liye ek qabool dua hai. Main chahunga ke, agar Allah chahe, main apni dua ko Qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye shafa'at ke tor par mo'khar karun.'"
"819","[AI-translation] Doosri sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind hadees riwayat ki gai hai."
"820","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah se milne se muhabbat kare, Allah us se milne se muhabbat farmata hai; aur jo Allah se milne ko napasand kare, Allah us se milne ko napasand farmata hai.' Rawi ne kaha: Main Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aaya aur un se kaha: Agar woh sach hai jo Abu Hurairah Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain to ham halak hue. Unhon ne kaha: Halak woh hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qaul se halak ho. Phir unhon ne kaha: Woh kya bayan karte hain? Main ne kaha: Woh kahte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah se milne se muhabbat kare, Allah us se milne se muhabbat farmata hai; aur jo Allah se milne ko napasand kare, Allah us se milne ko napasand farmata hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Main ne yeh Aap se suna: 'Kya tum jante ho yeh kab hoga? Yeh us waqt hoga jab maut ke waqt nigaah uth jae, jab saans seene mein ghute, ungliyan zakhmi hon, aur baal khade ho jayen. Us waqt jo Allah se milne se muhabbat kare, Allah us se milne se muhabbat farmata hai; aur jo Us se milne ko napasand kare, Allah us se milne ko napasand farmata hai.'"
"821","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo «لَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ إِلَّا بِاللَّهِ» padhe, woh us ke liye ninnave beemariyon ke liye shifa hai; un mein se sab se kam gham hai.'"
"822","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Har nabi ki ek qabool dua hai; jab woh dua karta hai to us ki dua qabool hoti hai aur jo woh mangta hai use diya jata hai. Raha main, to main ne apni dua ko Qayamat ke din apni ummat ki shafa'at ke liye rok rakha hai.'"
"823","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah Pak hai aur sirf pak ko qabool farmata hai. Allah ne rasoolon ko us ka hukm diya hai jo Us ne mominon ko hukm diya hai: Aey rasoolon ki jama'at! Pak cheezon mein se khao. Aur Us ne farmaya: Aey mominon! Un pak cheezon mein se khao jo Ham ne tumhen rizq diya hai. Phir Aap ne ek aadmi ka zikr farmaya jo lamba safar karta hai: us ke baal bikhre hue aur paon gard alood hain, woh apne dono hath aasman ki taraf uthata hai (dua mangte hue), jabke us ka khana, peena, aur libas haraam (kamai) se hai, aur use haraam se ghiza di gai hai. To us ki dua kaise qabool ho sakti hai?'"
"824","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah ko apne dil mein yaad kare, Allah use Apne paas yaad farmata hai. Jo Allah ko majlis mein yaad kare, Allah use us majlis se behtar majlis mein yaad farmata hai jis mein us ne Use yaad kiya. Jo Us se ek balisht qareeb ho, Woh us se ek hath qareeb hota hai. Jo Us se ek hath qareeb ho, Woh us se do hath qareeb hota hai. Jo Us ke paas chal kar aae, Woh us ke paas daud kar aata hai. Aur jo Us ke paas daud kar aae, Woh us ke paas tezi se aata hai.'"
"825","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen Arsh ke neeche jannat ke khazanon mein se ek khazane ke bare mein na bataun? «لَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ إِلَّا بِاللَّهِ». Allah farmata hai: Mere bande ne Islam qabool kiya aur us ne Meri poori ita'at ki.'"
"826","[AI-translation] Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Teen qism ke log hain jin ki dua radd nahin hoti: rozedar yahan tak ke woh roza khole, adil hukmaran, aur mazloom ki dua. Allah use badalon ke upar uthata hai, aur us ke liye aasmanon ke darwaze khole jate hain. Phir Rabb, Tabarak wa Ta'ala, farmata hai: Meri Izzat ki qasam! Main zaroor tumhari madad karunga, agarche kuch waqt ke baad.'"
"827","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Adil hukmaran ki dua radd nahin hoti.'"
"828","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Mehmani ka haq teen din hai; jo us se ziyada ho woh sadaqa hai. Aur mehman ke liye halal nahin hai ke us ke baad thehre taake ghar walon ko takleef de.' Aur main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo Allah se dua mange, Woh us ki dua qabool farmata hai: ya to Woh use jo us ne manga jald ata farmata hai, ya Woh us ki dua ke barabar us ke gunah muaf farmata hai.' Basharteke woh gunah ya qata' rahmi ke liye dua na mange, aur woh jaldi na kare. Poochha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Woh jaldi kaise karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh kahta hai: Main ne apne Rabb se dua mangi, lekin Us ne meri dua qabool nahin ki; ya main kisi cheez ka mohtaj nahin hun.'"
"829","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua mangte: 'Aey Allah! Mere agle aur pichle gunah, mere chhupe aur khule lagzish, aur meri hadd se tajawuz jise Tere siwa koi nahin janta, muaf farma. Tu Aage karne wala hai aur Tu Peechhe karne wala hai. Tere siwa koi mabud nahin hai.'"
"830","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Salman (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khair ki waseeyat farmai aur farmaya: 'Main tumhen chand kalime dena chahta hun; un ke liye hirs rakho, Allah Rahman se unhen mango, aur un se din raat dua mango. Kaho: Aey Allah! Main Tujh se aafiyat ke sath iman, husn khulq ke sath iman, aur us najaat ka sawal karta hun jis ke baad kamyabi aur Teri taraf se rahmat, Teri taraf se muafi aur bakhshish, aur Teri riza hai.'"
"831","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'SubhanAllah kahna meezan ka aadha hai, Allahu Akbar aasmanon aur zameen ko bhar deta hai, aur La ilaha illallah baghair kisi parda, dhakan, ya rukawat ke apne Rabb tak pahunchta hai.'"
"832","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ne tumhare liye behtareen kalam muntakhab farmaya hai, Quran mein se nahin jabke woh Quran ka hissa hai, «لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ، وَاللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ، وَسُبْحَانَ اللَّهِ وَبِحَمْدِهِ، وَالْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ، وَلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ إِلَّا بِاللَّهِ الْعَلِيِّ الْعَظِيمِ».'"
"833","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Umm Aiman (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bete Ibrahim ki walida ki laundi thin. To jab woh aatin to kahtin: «السَّلَامُ لَا عَلَيْكُمْ». To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen sirf «السَّلَام» kahne ki ijazat di."
"834","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ka Ism Azam in donon ayaton mein hai «وَإِلَهُكُمْ إِلَهٌ وَاحِدٌ لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا هُوَ الرَّحْمَنُ الرَّحِيمُ» aur Surah Ale Imran ki shuru ki ayat mein.'"
"835","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Buraidah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) isha ke waqt nikle aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mile. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ka hath pakda aur unhen masjid mein le aae, jahan ek aadmi in kalimon se dua mang raha tha: 'Aey Allah! Main Tujh se mangta hun; main gawahi deta hun ke Tu Allah hai, Ek, Tanha, Beniyaz, Jo na janta hai na jana gaya, aur Us ka koi hamsar nahin hai.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Us ne Allah se Us ke Ism Azam se dua mangi hai; jab Us se us se dua mangi jati hai to Woh jawab deta hai, aur jab Us se us se manga jata hai to Woh ata farmata hai.'"
"836","[AI-translation] Hazrat Yasirah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hidayat farmai: 'Tum tasbeeh (SubhanAllah), tahleel (La ilaha illallah), aur taqdees padha karo, aur unhen apni ungliyon ke poron par gino. Kyunke un se poocha jayega aur unhen bulwaya jayega. To ghaafil na ho, kahin tum rahmat se bhool na jao.'"
"837","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Bande ke liye do duayen qabool hoti hain: mazloom ki dua aur Musalman ki apne (Musalman) bhai ke liye us ki ghair maujudgi mein dua.'"
